      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yes, thank to &gt;G, and to Pydro for starting this thread. I was taught SotM a few months ago, and since then my 7yo son and I have had great fun with it. The game itself is clearly a labor or love, and we love it.</p><p>I&#39;m looking forward to my RRR (Rook city + infernal Relics Reprint) + promos + a couple of other things order. I think that &gt;G is being admirably flexible right now. You want both expansions in one box, cheaper than buying them separately would be? (Yes, of course I do!) You got it. You want just one of the expansions, no box, since you&#39;ve already got the other? You got it. Oh, you just want the box? You got it. And you get promos too.&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;m sure that there will be complaints from people who were hibernating in December, and so miss some of this but I don&#39;t think it&#39;s reasonable to expect you to be this flexible indefinitely.&nbsp;</p><p>Andrew, with best wishes for 2014 to all at &gt;G, and all in this community.</p>",
